5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf, okay?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. Let's keep a cool head and look at the facts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good evening. I hope we can all find a peaceful resolution to this.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! I'll help everyone find the bad guy. Let's do this!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to meet you all. I trust logic will guide us to the correct conclusion.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,Does anyone have a strategy? I'm just so curious about how we'll figure it out!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,It's too early for a strategy. We need more information first.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. Let us observe each other for a while.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, you're so energetic! I like it! I'll trust your instincts!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford yet, Kenji. Let's remain objective.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Aww, Benjamin, you're so serious! But you're right, we have to be careful.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
