31,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. Who do you guys suspect?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's only the first day. We have no evidence yet.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have some information. Mio, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! @Jonathan, are you the Seer? That's crazy!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A bold claim so early. Jonathan, if you are the Seer, your revelation is quite efficient.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mio,,"What?! @Jonathan, that's a lie! I'm just a normal girl! Why would you say that?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, the logic is simple. If he's the werewolf, he's framing Mio.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am the Seer. I saw the truth last night.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I can't believe it! Mio, are you really the werewolf?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, your reaction is quite emotional. While expected, it doesn't disprove the Seer's claim.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm emotional because I'm being accused for no reason! Please believe me!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, is there any reason you would lie about being the Seer?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,None. I only wish for the village to be safe.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I want to believe Mio, but if Jonathan is the Seer, we have to listen to him!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. The risk of executing a villager is high, but the risk of keeping a werewolf is higher.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mio,,"This is so unfair! Please, just think about it!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I believe we should follow the Seer's lead for now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am certain of what I saw.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Sorry Mio, but I'll go with Jonathan!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic dictates we trust the Seer's divination. I vote for Mio.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
